    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48134" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Thĕon</span></b> , ōnis,
			m.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A satirical poet.</i>— Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Thĕōnīnus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to Theon</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dens,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor. Ep. 1, 18, 82</span></i>
			. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A celebrated Samian painter</i>, <i><span class="en">Quint. 12,
				10, 6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 35, 11, 40, §
		144</span></i>.</div>
